        "cooked": "<p>I mean like actually write down and make a list of the names of the comics, then try to put them in order. Like that kind of thing. We wouldn’t end up posting that whole list; we’re just using them as a way to keep track of what’s going on. And this doesn’t seem like something anyone could do in an hour. I’m talking about looking at every single card and making a timeline which includes all of them. Again, we won’t bore everyone with that; it’s just a way to help guide us.</p>",
